        "Content": "4 Bedroom House in Showhouse condition extending to approximately 166 sq. m (1788 sq. ft)\r\n\r\nThis immaculately presented residence is very conveniently located a short walk to Clonakilty Town centre.\r\n\r\nIt has wonderful kerb appeal and is situated on a cul-de-sac with one row of high end residential property. The property itself is a beautifully finished two-storey home, completed to a high standard with quality fixtures and fittings throughout.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor has been thoughtfully designed to provide modern and comfortable family living, comprising a spacious entrance hall, open-plan kitchen/dining room which opens up to the rear garden, utility room and a recently fully renovated shower room. There is also a large, bright living room, together with a separate reception room that would be ideally suited as a playroom or home office, with sliding-door access to a useful storage area.\r\n\r\nUpstairs there are 4 generous sized double bedrooms (Two of which contain ensuites) and a family bathroom. There is a Stira to a floored attic which provides plenty of storage. The attic can easily be converted to further accommodation if desired.\r\n\r\nNo. 2 benefits from a private driveway providing parking for two cars, a front patio area with French drains, and convenient side access, ideal for bins, bicycles and other storage. To the rear, there is a large south-facing garden, laid mainly in lawn, with a garden room, patio area with seating, and a dedicated bike storage shed.\r\n\r\nThe property has a lovely private situation yet is so conveniently located. It is less than 1km to the N71 National Road which connects Cork City with Bandon, Clonakilty and all the way west to Kenmare in Co. Kerry.\r\n\r\nThe vibrant heritage town of Clonakilty is renowned for its welcoming community and excellent range of amenities, including schools, healthcare services, supermarkets, boutique shops, cafés, award-winning restaurants, hotels and a wealth of independent local businesses.\r\n\r\nCork International Airport is 45 minutes away and Cork City Centre 50 minutes.\r\n\r\nThere are many Beautiful natural amenities including Inchydoney, Long Strand, Castlefreke Forest Trail, Owenahincha, The Warren, Red Strand, Blind Strand, Broadstrand to name a few that are only a short drive away.\r\n\r\nThere is pedestrian pathway to Clonakilty Park Hotel opposite which offers an excellent range of facilities, including the award-winning Leisure Club with 20m swimming pool, toddler pool, sauna, steam room, jacuzzi and fully equipped gym, together with fitness classes and treatment facilities. The hotel also features a Bar & Bistro, a three-screen cinema, children’s play areas, outdoor playground, Adventure Centre with high ropes, zip wiring and climbing walls, and Adventure Mini Golf, making it an exceptional amenity a stroll away.\r\n\r\nFeatures–\r\n\r\nOil Fired Central Heating System\r\n\r\nMains Water & Drainage\r\n\r\nIntegrated Appliances\r\n\r\nRecently Fully Renovated Shower Room\r\n\r\nPlayroom/Office with sliding-door access to a large, useful storage area\r\n\r\nStira to the Floored Attic – Wired and Plumbed, can easily be converted to further accommodation\r\n\r\nCustom Made to Measure Metal Front Gates\r\n\r\nBike Store\r\n\r\n12ft X 8ft Insulated Garden Room\r\n\r\nFurther Electricity Points at either end of the Rear Garden\r\n\r\nEircode: P85 KV00 (Property Specific Code)\r\n\r\nViewing Is Highly Recommended – Strictly By Appointment Only\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: All information provided is to the best of our knowledge but is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No warranties or representations are made regarding the accuracy, completeness, condition or planning status of the property. Interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of all information provided, including measurements, boundaries, size or acreage, BER details and services. All measurements and distances are approximate and for guidance only. Photographs and video are for illustrative purposes and may include items not included in the sale (e.g. furniture)."
